hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18479","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us, from Husayn, from Salim ibn Abi al-Jad, from a man of us of Ashja who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saw a gold ring on me and ordered me to cast it away, so I cast it away to this day of mine."
